      "summary": "Meridian Concierge: a multi-agent AI customer-support platform (intake-triage / resolution / escalation agents) for e-commerce sellers. Launched to automate first-line ticket handling \u2014 routing, refund proposals, and shipping-address changes \u2014 while keeping clearly-defined high-risk actions gated behind a human.",
